---
---

<section id="cara-kerja" class="section has-bottom-glow hiw-section">
  <div class="section-bottom-glow section-bottom-glow-amber section-bottom-glow-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <div class="section-label">Cara Kerja</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Proses Simple, Hasil Nyata</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Tidak ribet. Tidak butuh pengetahuan teknis. Kami yang urus semuanya.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num"><span>01</span></div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">Konsultasi</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Ceritakan kebutuhan bisnis Anda. Kami dengarkan, analisis, dan beri rekomendasi solusi terbaik, gratis tanpa komitmen.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-arrow reveal">&rarr;</div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num"><span>02</span></div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">Bangun</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Tim kami mengerjakan proyek dengan update progres berkala. Anda bisa pantau dan beri masukan di setiap tahap.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-arrow reveal">&rarr;</div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num"><span>03</span></div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3 class="step-title">Serahkan</h3>
          <p class="step-desc">Produk jadi, training penggunaan, dan dukungan purna jual. Anda siap jalankan bisnis digital dengan percaya diri.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.steps-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  align-items: center;
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .step-arrow { display: none; }
}

.step {
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.step-num {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  background: var(--color-primary-100);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.step-num span {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  color: var(--color-primary-800);
  line-height: 1;
}

.step-title {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.step-desc {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.step-arrow {
  font-size: 24px;
  color: var(--color-border-strong);
  font-weight: 300;
  text-align: center;
}

</style>
